{"4078360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "When We Arrive", "steam_appid": 4078360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4688480], "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/d10c2fdebe505919d46ce16f885803ea.avif?t=1782560198\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras_big/d10c2fdebe505919d46ce16f885803ea.avif?t=1782560198 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The god Auran has vanished. His temple lies somewhere in the mountains, far beyond the forest, the swamps and everything in between. Can you reach it and find Auran?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🗺️ Journey with Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through the world alone or bring up to 3 friends along. Help each other out, or secretly steal your best friend's last ration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/22d1f3af17bb4fcd79ff8c98a80ccba3.poster.avif?t=1782560198\" width=1170 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/22d1f3af17bb4fcd79ff8c98a80ccba3.webm?t=1782560198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/22d1f3af17bb4fcd79ff8c98a80ccba3.mp4?t=1782560198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🧭 The Journey Is the Goal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every journey takes you through new landscapes, unexpected events and places you missed last time. Auran's temple waits somewhere at the end. Whether you make it is another question.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/13ea91701eaf4e5082cac56f44b1b9fc.poster.avif?t=1782560198\" width=1170 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/13ea91701eaf4e5082cac56f44b1b9fc.webm?t=1782560198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/13ea91701eaf4e5082cac56f44b1b9fc.mp4?t=1782560198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💀 Survive the Dangers of the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblin ambushes, deadly traps, and unpredictable events will constantly put you and your friends to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/13cf2a3bb176aaaaac7ec104e72f34ae.poster.avif?t=1782560198\" width=1170 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/13cf2a3bb176aaaaac7ec104e72f34ae.webm?t=1782560198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/13cf2a3bb176aaaaac7ec104e72f34ae.mp4?t=1782560198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💎 Find Treasure and Relics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold, equipment, rare relics. Some you'll find in chests, some in suspicious mounds, and some would have been better left where they were.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/fd74831d72f11a71c0d0f15817a66e5c.poster.avif?t=1782560198\" width=1170 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/fd74831d72f11a71c0d0f15817a66e5c.webm?t=1782560198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/fd74831d72f11a71c0d0f15817a66e5c.mp4?t=1782560198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎭 Meet the Inhabitants of the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with villagers, listen to their stories, or uncover clues that lead to hidden locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/3a3e6561f3c3ef37f36a2aef378e7e13.poster.avif?t=1782560198\" width=1170 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/3a3e6561f3c3ef37f36a2aef378e7e13.webm?t=1782560198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/3a3e6561f3c3ef37f36a2aef378e7e13.mp4?t=1782560198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚙️ Grow stronger with every journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every failed attempt brings you more experience. New classes, abilities, equipment. And the most important question before each run: shovel or health potion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The god Auran has vanished. His temple lies somewhere in the mountains, far beyond the forest, the swamps and everything in between. Can you reach it and find Auran?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🗺️ Journey with Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through the world alone or bring up to 3 friends along. Help each other out, or secretly